OL,3,GNEWSAHotel painted pink without
OL,4,Apermission to be redone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hotel painted bright pink without
OL,7,Fpermission will be repainted in a
OL,8,Flighter colour.
OL,10,FCaedmon House, Whitby, which forms part
OL,11,Fof The Royal Hotel, was painted pink in
OL,12,F2025, despite not having the necessary
OL,13,Flisted building consent.
OL,15,FThe hotel will now be redone in a pale
OL,16,Fpink colour, after North Yorkshire
OL,17,FCouncil and the hotel came to an
OL,18,Fagreement about a suitable colour that
OL,19,Fwould also protect the history of the
OL,20,FGrade II listed building.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
